    "text": "<p>For a certain first order reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>32</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of the reactant is left after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>570</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The rate constant of this reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> (Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p><p>[Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>301</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></math>]</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
