  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mtext>st&#160;</mtext></msup></math> order reaction,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>570</mn><mi>sec</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>999</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
